.TH MYSTRCAT 3 "September 2026" "libmyutils" "Library Functions Manual"
.SH NAME
mystrcat \- concatenate two strings
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "mystrfunctions.h"
.sp
.BI "int mystrcat(char *" dest ", const char *" src );
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B mystrcat()
function appends a copy of the string pointed to by
.I src
to the end of the string pointed to by
.I dest.
The caller must ensure
.I dest
has enough allocated space to hold both its original contents and
.I src,
plus the terminating null byte.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns 0 on success.
